## 2 · Bar histogram — discrete buckets

Separated columns, baseline axis, hovered bucket shows its count. Best when each
bucket is a meaningful unit (e.g. `bucket:"week"`) rather than a smooth flow.

```
┌─ 📊  Tickets opened ────────────── 90d ┐
│                              ▆          │
│                      █       █     █    │
│              █       █   █   █  █  █    │
│      █   █   █   █   █   █   █  █  █    │
│   █  █   █   █   █   █   █   █  █  █  █ │
│  ─┴──┴───┴───┴───┴───┴───┴───┴──┴──┴──  │
│   W1            W5            W9    now  │
│                                         │
│   peak  31 · wk 7      avg  19 / wk     │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- **Reads:** per-bucket counts as bars; footer shows peak + average.
- **Best at:** ≥ 6 wide. Few buckets (weeks) read better than 90 daily bars.
- **Config:** `chart:"bars"`. Optional new `showStats?: boolean` for the footer line.

