## 3 · Inline strip — compact / wide-short variant

One row: label, current value, tiny sparkline, delta. The auto-collapse target for
#1 on short tiles, and great for packing several trends in a column.

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 📈 New Deals   142  ▁▂▃▃▄▅▆█  ▲18%       │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘

stacked, e.g. inside a "Pipeline health" group:

┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Deals      142  ▁▂▃▃▄▅▆█  ▲ 18%          │
│ Calls      308  ▅▆▄▆▇▆██  ▲  6%          │
│ No-shows    12  ▆▅▄▃▂▂▁▁  ▼ 41%   good   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- **Reads:** headline value + single-row sparkline + delta.
- **Best at:** ≤ 2 tiles tall (any width). Auto-selected when `box.height` is small.
- **Config:** add `variant?: "auto" | "card" | "strip"` (mirrors List/Metric pattern).

