## 5 · Contribution heatmap — calendar grid

GitHub-style intensity grid for `bucket:"day"`. Day-of-week rows × week columns;
cell shade = that day's event count. Surfaces weekly rhythm + streaks that a line hides.

```
┌─ 🗓  Activity ───────────────────── 90d ┐
│        Apr      May      Jun            │
│   Mon  ░▒▓░ ░▓██ ▒▓█▓ ░▒▓█ ▓██▒         │
│   Tue  ▒▓██ ▓███ ░▒▓▓ ▓███ ██▓░         │
│   Wed  ░░▒▓ ▒▓█▓ ▓███ ░▒▓█ ▓█▓▒         │
│   Thu  ▓███ ░▒▓▓ ▒▓██ ▓███ ░▒▓▓         │
│   Fri  ▒▓▓░ ▓██▒ ░░▒▓ ▒▓█▓ ▓███         │
│   Sat  ░░░▒ ░▒▒░ ▒▓▓░ ░░▒▓ ▒▓░░         │
│   Sun  ░░░░ ░░▒░ ░░░▒ ░▒░░ ▒░░░         │
│                                         │
│   less ░ ▒ ▓ █ more     1,204 events    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- **Reads:** daily bucket counts mapped to 4 intensity bands.
- **Best at:** ≥ 7 wide, ≥ 6 tall; only meaningful for `bucket:"day"` + `since:"90d"`.
- **Config:** add `chart:"heatmap"` to the existing union. Forces daily buckets.

