## Summary

| # | Name | chart value | New config | Strength | Min size |
|---|------|-------------|-----------|----------|----------|
| 1 | Stat + Area | `area` | — | Headline KPI + shape | 5×4 |
| 2 | Bar histogram | `bars` | `showStats?` | Discrete buckets, peak/avg | 6×3 |
| 3 | Inline strip | `area` | `variant?` | Dense, stackable | any×2 |
| 4 | Period overlay | `area` | `compare?` | Visual vs-prior | 6×5 |
| 5 | Heatmap | `heatmap` | `chart` enum | Rhythm + streaks | 7×6 |

**Recommendation:** ship **#1** as the default render and **#3** as its auto-collapse
form (one widget, size-responsive — no new top-level type). **#2** is just the existing
`chart:"bars"` branch. **#4** and **#5** are the two genuinely new capabilities worth a
config flag each (`compare?`, `chart:"heatmap"`).
